WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.109
- Oh, we're having pizza for lunch today.

00:00:03.109 --> 00:00:07.794
- Hallelujah!

00:00:07.794 --> 00:00:09.477
(claps)

00:00:09.477 --> 00:00:11.481
(gospel music in background)
Hallelujah, this evening.

00:00:11.481 --> 00:00:13.293
He's able. (claps)

00:00:13.293 --> 00:00:15.661
Thank ya, thank ya!

00:00:16.872 --> 00:00:18.019
- Darn it!

00:00:18.019 --> 00:00:18.718
- What's the matter?

00:00:18.718 --> 00:00:19.948
- My computer's not working.

00:00:19.948 --> 00:00:21.774
- Oh, here. Let me help, let me help.

00:00:23.066 --> 00:00:24.506
Heavenly Father, we upload this prayer

00:00:24.506 --> 00:00:25.844
to you this evenin.

00:00:25.844 --> 00:00:28.292
Delete the devil's cookies, Jesus.

00:00:28.292 --> 00:00:30.353
In your name, amen.

00:00:30.353 --> 00:00:31.708
- Amen?

00:00:31.708 --> 00:00:33.287
- Give it a try.

00:00:33.287 --> 00:00:35.060
- It's not working.

00:00:42.326 --> 00:00:44.219
- Oh hey, Tracy. How's it goin?

00:00:44.219 --> 00:00:45.646
- Oh, my brother, I will tell you.

00:00:45.646 --> 00:00:48.147
I have been lied on, I have been cheated,

00:00:48.147 --> 00:00:50.214
and just called everything
but a child of God.

00:00:50.214 --> 00:00:51.617
But that's alright, you know why?

00:00:51.617 --> 00:00:54.225
'Cause as long as I got King Jesus,

00:00:54.225 --> 00:00:56.458
I don't need nobody else.

00:00:56.458 --> 00:00:57.506
How are you?

00:00:58.699 --> 00:00:59.549
- Fine.

00:01:00.274 --> 00:01:01.737
- Alright guys, let's get started.

00:01:01.737 --> 00:01:03.363
Can everybody kneel and bow your heads

00:01:03.363 --> 00:01:05.188
for a word of prayer please?

00:01:08.399 --> 00:01:09.772
Quickly, please.

00:01:10.632 --> 00:01:12.235
Spirit of the living God,

00:01:12.235 --> 00:01:15.601
fall fresh on this PowerPoint
presentation this evening.

00:01:18.077 --> 00:01:19.512
- Hey, Tracy. Here's your paycheck.

00:01:19.512 --> 00:01:21.213
- Offering plate.

00:01:21.213 --> 00:01:22.729
- Okay.

00:01:22.729 --> 00:01:24.152
- Now I want you to turn to your neighbor

00:01:24.152 --> 00:01:25.503
and say "Neighbor!"

00:01:26.858 --> 00:01:29.938
- [Group] Neighbor?
- God has blessed

00:01:29.938 --> 00:01:31.438
these sales projections.

00:01:31.438 --> 00:01:35.362
- [Group] God has blessed
these sales projections.

00:01:35.362 --> 00:01:37.096
- Amen, amen. Yes, he has.

00:01:37.096 --> 00:01:38.970
That ain't nottin but God.

00:01:38.970 --> 00:01:41.586
- Oh my God, Tracy, I did
something awful this weekend,

00:01:41.586 --> 00:01:43.091
and I need to talk to someone about it.

00:01:43.091 --> 00:01:45.761
- Wait, wait. Come with me.

00:01:50.529 --> 00:01:52.154
- Where are we?

00:01:52.154 --> 00:01:54.655
Can't we just talk normally?

00:01:54.655 --> 00:01:56.320
- Yes, yes. Go ahead.

00:01:56.320 --> 00:01:57.341
- [Woman] See ya, Tracy.

00:01:57.341 --> 00:02:00.351
- Go in peace, and sin no more.

00:02:02.257 --> 00:02:04.741
- [Woman] Did you build this?

00:02:04.741 --> 00:02:06.716
Do you sculpt wood?

00:02:06.716 --> 00:02:08.539
Tracy, how do I get outta here?

00:02:09.751 --> 00:02:10.805
Tracy?

00:02:10.805 --> 00:02:12.669
Is that my old desk?

00:02:12.669 --> 00:02:13.752
Tracy?

